      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"markdown\"><p>请使用递归法求出如下数列：<span class=\"katex math inline\">1</span> <span class=\"katex math inline\">3</span> <span class=\"katex math inline\">5</span> <span class=\"katex math inline\">7</span> <span class=\"katex math inline\">9</span> <span class=\"katex math inline\">\\dots</span> 中第 <span class=\"katex math inline\">N</span> 项的值。</p>\n</div>            </div>",
      "text": "请使用递归法求出如下数列：1 3 5 7 9 \\dots 中第 N 项的值。"
    },
    {
